  "notes": [
    "Input is a Diff: kind, catalog_sku, cost_before, cost_after (decimal strings or null), notes.",
    "Expected bucket is one of safe | risky | anomaly. Unknown kinds MUST classify as anomaly.",
    "mandatory_option_price_change: risky iff abs((after-before)/before)*100 > 10 (strict); missing cost_before/cost_after or cost_before == 0 -> risky.",
    "os_image_removed is deliberately NOT exported. The archive classifies it SAFE with a comment 'only if not in active use; epic-1 will refine' (review H6). Its correct bucket is unresolved policy; the port owner must decide it before shipping.",
    "Anomaly kinds take precedence over everything else."
  ],
